{{--
    The world map that sits inside the Impact section.

    This is the designer's own inline SVG, kept whole and lifted into its own
    partial only so `impact.blade.php` stays readable — it is roughly 160KB of
    path data on its own. It is decoration: there are no labels, no place
    names and no data in it, so it is marked `aria-hidden` and the reference's
    original alt text, which described countries we have no figures for, is
    gone with it.

    The template drew this map with Framer Motion, so in the reference every
    landmass, route and pin arrives hidden — `opacity:0` on the base map,
    `scale(0)` on the ten pins, and `stroke-dasharray="0 1"` on the routes,
    which hides a stroke just as completely as `opacity:0` does. We do not
    ship Framer Motion, so all of that is stripped and the map is emitted in
    its finished, resting state. The two rings around the hub keep the size
    and opacity they settle at, written as SVG attributes instead of a
    half-finished animation.
--}}
